{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 49, :comments ["<b>If you will do kindness.</b> That in order to secure my master's desire, you set aside your own desire and consent to send your daughter to a distant land, and do not insist on acquiring relatives for her in your own land." "<b>And truth.</b> That you want benefit and honor for your daughter as is fitting for you — and this is achieved by bringing her into the house of Abraham."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:30.905855566Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}